{"id":"6852172e9b645edd","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-kleene-path-invariant.md","title":"逐层路径表达式的正确性","display":"thm-kleene-path-invariant — 逐层路径表达式的正确性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-kleene-path-invariant","aliases":["73-thm-kleene-path-invariant"],"display":"thm-kleene-path-invariant — 逐层路径表达式的正确性","depends_on":["[[73-df-kleene-path-expressions]]","[[73-df-regex-denotation]]","[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§3.2.1, Theorem 3.4, print pp. 93–97; PDF pp. 115–119","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":3},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-kleene-path-invariant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-kleene-path-invariant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-path-invariant — 逐层路径表达式的正确性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ab184a928aade67\" href=\"?note=5ab184a928aade67\" title=\"73-df-kleene-path-expressions\">73-df-kleene-path-expressions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d47feb8e4b903a2e\" href=\"?note=d47feb8e4b903a2e\" title=\"73-df-regex-denotation\">73-df-regex-denotation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§3.2.1, Theorem 3.4, print pp. 93–97; PDF pp. 115–119"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5ab184a928aade67\" href=\"?note=5ab184a928aade67\" title=\"73-df-kleene-path-expressions\">73-df-kleene-path-expressions</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,Q,n,R^k_{ij},E_M\">\\(M,Q,n,R^k_{ij},E_M\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in Q\">\\(i,j\\in Q\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 是有限状态序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 是有限输入词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ R^k_{ij}⟧_\\Sigma=\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q:\\{0,\\ldots,|w|\\}\\to Q\\;\\bigl[q(0)=i\\land q(|w|)=j\\land\n(\\forall h\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\\;\\delta(q(h),w(h))=q(h+1))\\land\n(\\forall h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\\;q(h)\\le k)\\bigr]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ R^k_{ij}⟧_\\Sigma=\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q:\\{0,\\ldots,|w|\\}\\to Q\\;\\bigl[q(0)=i\\land q(|w|)=j\\land\n(\\forall h\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\\;\\delta(q(h),w(h))=q(h+1))\\land\n(\\forall h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\\;q(h)\\le k)\\bigr]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ E_M⟧_\\Sigma=L(M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ E_M⟧_\\Sigma=L(M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按 k 归纳。k=0 只有空路径与单边路径。第 k+1 层把路径分为不以 k+1 为中间状态的情形，和首次到达、若干次返回、最后离开 k+1 的情形；三段分别给出递归式的连接与星号。最后对所有终态取并。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-kleene-path-expressions","status":"resolved","id":"5ab184a928aade67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-kleene-path-expressions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regex-denotation","status":"resolved","id":"d47feb8e4b903a2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regex-denotation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-kleene-path-expressions","status":"resolved","id":"5ab184a928aade67","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[73-df-kleene-path-expressions]] 的 $M,Q,n,R^k_{ij},E_M$；$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$，$i,j\\in Q$。$q$ 是有限状态序列，$w$ 是有限输入词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M,Q,n,R^k_{ij},E_M","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ R^k_{ij}⟧_\\Sigma=\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q:\\{0,\\ldots,|w|\\}\\to Q\\;\\bigl[q(0)=i\\land q(|w|)=j\\land\n(\\forall h\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\\;\\delta(q(h),w(h))=q(h+1))\\land\n(\\forall h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\\;q(h)\\le k)\\bigr]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"⟦ E_M⟧_\\Sigma=L(M).","display":true}],"bytes":1507,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-kleene-path-invariant|逐层路径表达式的正确性]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["5ab184a928aade67","d47feb8e4b903a2e","3b7a967565c86f39"]}